From 03a08fffe34cdf793e97c2656cf5b47876784665 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juaquin <bambifu33@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:37:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Release 0.0.1: fix Perfect popup crash and vendor
 hscript-plus

- PopUpStuff: fall back to the Sick popup when the perfect texture is
  missing, instead of crashing on a null graphic.
- Vendor hscript-plus (MIT, DleanJeans) under source/hscriptplus, with its
  package renamed from hscript to hscriptplus so it does not clash with the
  hscript package used by Polymod. Not wired into the engine yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015wUwjuVovsP68uLFK1dWVF
